{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13UtilityWindowV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UtilityWindow","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"UtilityWindow"}],"title":"UtilityWindow","symbolKind":"struct"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UtilityWindow","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4ViewP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Utility windows are typically used to display controls, settings, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"information associated the main content of an application, sometimes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"referred to as tool palettes or inspector windows. Because of this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"role, they have specialized behavior compared to all other windows:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"They receive ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusedValues","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from the focused main scene in an application,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"similar to commands in the main menu, which can be used to display","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"information on the active content as the user focuses on different scenes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"They have a default window level of ","type":"text"},{"code":".floating","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so they remain visible","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when moving focus between the main scenes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"They hide when the window is no longer active.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"They only become focused when explicitly needed, such as clicking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the titlebar or on a focusable view.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When focused, they can be dismissed with the Escape key.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"They are not minimizable by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"@main","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"struct PhotoBrowser: App {","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"var body: some Scene {","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"WindowGroup {","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PhotoGallery()","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"}","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["      UtilityWindow(\"Photo Info\", id: \"photo-info\") {","          PhotoInfoViewer()","      }","  }"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"}","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"struct PhotoInfoViewer: View {","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"\/\/ Automatically updates to the photo selection from whichever","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"\/\/ photo gallery window is focused.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"@FocusedValue(PhotoSelection.self) private var selectedPhotos","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["  var body: some View {","      Text(\"\\(selectedPhotos.count) photos selected\")","  }"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"}","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UtilityWindow"},{"type":"text","text":" will automatically add a menu item to show\/hide itself in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the “View” menu. This can be removed by applying "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/commandsRemoved()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the utility window, and manually placing a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowVisibilityToggle"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elsewhere in an app’s commands. Utility windows can also be programmatically"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/openWindow"},{"type":"text","text":" and dismissed using"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswif